      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "权重矩阵与神经元",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "权重矩阵与神经元",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "math-0205",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "000000cd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10205,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "W_Q ∈ R^(d×d)：\n第 i 行 / 第 j 列的 wᵢⱼ 是从输入特征 i\n到输出特征 j 的权重。\n\n单个输出神经元：q_j = Σᵢ ĥ_i·wᵢⱼ + b_j",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "W_Q ∈ R^(d×d)：\n第 i 行 / 第 j 列的 wᵢⱼ 是从输入特征 i\n到输出特征 j 的权重。\n\n单个输出神经元：q_j = Σᵢ ĥ_i·wᵢⱼ + b_j",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
