      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "头的维度切分（不是减少总维度）",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "头的维度切分（不是减少总维度）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "math-0365",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3170,
      "y": 1105,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "0000016d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10365,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20365,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "d = h·d_h = 96·128 = 12,288\n\nQ, K, V：T×12,288\n切成 96 份：每份 T×128\n每个头的分数矩阵：T×128 · 128×T = T×T\n96 个头拼接后：T×(96·128) = T×12,288",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "d = h·d_h = 96·128 = 12,288\n\nQ, K, V：T×12,288\n切成 96 份：每份 T×128\n每个头的分数矩阵：T×128 · 128×T = T×T\n96 个头拼接后：T×(96·128) = T×12,288",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
