      "text": "4d = 49,152 个隐藏神经元",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4d = 49,152 个隐藏神经元",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "math-0480",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2390,
      "y": 1960,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 82,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#78350f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "000001e0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10480,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "u_k = Σᵢ xᵢ·W₁ᵢₖ + b₁ₖ；\ny_j = Σₖ GELU(u_k)·W₂ₖⱼ + b₂ⱼ\nW₁：每个中间神经元接收 d=12,288 个输入；\nW₂：再把 49,152 个中间神经元投影回 d=12,288。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "u_k = Σᵢ xᵢ·W₁ᵢₖ + b₁ₖ；\ny_j = Σₖ GELU(u_k)·W₂ₖⱼ + b₂ⱼ\nW₁：每个中间神经元接收 d=12,288 个输入；\nW₂：再把 49,152 个中间神经元投影回 d=12,288。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
