      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Logits 的含义",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logits 的含义",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "math-0564",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 145,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "00000234",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10564,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20564,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H̄_L：T 个位置 × 每个位置 12,288 个隐藏特征\nEᵀ：每个词元对应一列 12,288 维向量\n\n每个位置 t 得到 50,257 个分数：\nlogits_t = h̄_L,t · Eᵀ ∈ R^(1×50,257)\nSoftmax 后成为下一个 Token 的概率分布。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "H̄_L：T 个位置 × 每个位置 12,288 个隐藏特征\nEᵀ：每个词元对应一列 12,288 维向量\n\n每个位置 t 得到 50,257 个分数：\nlogits_t = h̄_L,t · Eᵀ ∈ R^(1×50,257)\nSoftmax 后成为下一个 Token 的概率分布。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
