    },
    {
      "id": "math-0566",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 2754,
      "width": 3590,
      "height": 55,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "00000236",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10566,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20566,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "读图要点：向量是矩阵的一行（1×d）；矩阵乘法先看形状再看数值；d=12,288 在所有 Block 输入/输出处保持不变，只有每个注意力头暂时变成 128 维，MLP 中间层扩展到 4d=49,152。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "读图要点：向量是矩阵的一行（1×d）；矩阵乘法先看形状再看数值；d=12,288 在所有 Block 输入/输出处保持不变，只有每个注意力头暂时变成 128 维，MLP 中间层扩展到 4d=49,152。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
